      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جبَنهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجْبِينٌ</span>, <i>He attributed to him
cowardice</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُبْن</span>). (S.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ يُجَبَّنُ</span>, inf. n.
as above, <i>He is accused of cowardice.</i> (K.)

